<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 13.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 13.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for March 13 on Wednesday. The litas</p>
<p>is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		    13.03.97     08.03.97</p>
<p>    USD	     4.0000	 4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	     6.3944	 6.4316</p>
<p>    DEM	     2.3410	 2.3339</p>
<p>    ECU	     4.5490	 4.5430</p>
<p>    100JPY	  3.2626	 3.3006</p>
<p>    SEK	     0.5211	 0.5233</p>
<p>    FIM	     0.7842	 0.7819</p>
<p>    EKK	     0.2924	 0.2917</p>
<p>    LAT	     6.8289	 6.8324</p>
<p>    1000RUR	 0.7021	 0.7022</p>
<p>    PLN	     1.2961	 1.2960</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
